  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nFree shipping on orders $150+\n\nShop\nMagazine\nAbout\nCart\nAbout\nCountry of Origin is a modern knitwear brand founded by Ben Taylor and Alice Liptrot.\nEverything is crafted with care at our purpose-built factory in Wigston, Leicestershire.\nWith an emphasis on strong color palettes and high-quality yarns, we supply a curated collection of knitwear for modern living.\nOur company began in a small railway arch in South London.\nOur ambition was to oversee the manufacturing process as closely as possible to ensure we produced highly crafted knitwear and fair working practices for the people making it.\nWith just 2 knitting machines and a small team, our orders quickly outgrew our capacity to fulfill them.\nThen by chance...\nA meeting with industry veterans Saïd and Keith set a new partnership in motion that saw the opening of our new factory in Wigston, pursuing the same values but on a much larger scale.\nBetween them, Saïd and Keith have more than 70 years of experience in the industry. We firmly believe: If this duo doesn't know something about knitwear, it mustn't be worth knowing.\nStay in the know\nEmail\n\nFollow us on social media\n\nTwitter\nFacebook\nInstagram\nTikTok\nYouTube\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Country of Origin. © 2026 Powered by Shopify"
